ttery provides a stable 1.5V output and reliable performance for devices such as TV remotes, wireless keyboards, computer mice, toys, flashlights, and other small electronics.</h2><p align=\"left\"><br></p><p align=\"left\"><br>Equipped with a built-in USB Type-C charging port, the Remax AAA02 allows you to recharge the battery directly using a USB cable. There is no need for a separate battery charger—simply connect it to a power bank, laptop, or USB adapter for convenient charging anywhere.<br><br>With an 814mWh energy capacity, this battery delivers long-lasting performance and supports multiple recharge cycles, making it both cost-effective and environmentally friendly. The compact AAA size design ensures full compatibility with all standard AAA battery devices.<br><br>Whether for home, office, or travel use, the Remax AAA02 rechargeable battery provides a dependable and sustainable power source for your daily gadgets.<br><br></p><h3 align=\"left\">Key Features</h3><div align=\"left\"><ul><li>High-quality AAA lithium rechargeable battery</li><li>USB Type-C charging port for easy and convenient charging<br></li><li>814mWh capacity for longer usage time<br></li><li>Stable 1.5V output for consistent device performance<br></li><li>No external charger required<br></li><li>Lightweight and compact standard AAA size<br></li><li>Environmentally friendly and reusable design<br></li><li>Ideal for remotes, toys, wireless keyboards, flashlights, and other small devices</li></ul><h5>Perfect for home, office, and travel use, the Remax AAA02 USB-C rechargeable battery offers convenience, reliability, and sustainable power for everyday electronics. Available now at D CORE with trusted quality and competitive pricing in Bangladesh.</h5><p><br><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Remax/Screenshot%202026-03-07%20at%2023-40-13%20AAA02%20New%20energy%20AAA%20rechargeable%20USB%20lithium%20battery%20814mWh%20-%20REMAX%EF%BC%88%E7%9D%BF%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%89.png\"></p></div>\n 